---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
---

<Layout
  title="Abdurakhmon Dadaboev"
  description="AI vision engineer building reliable computer vision systems for road data, inspection, and offline document intelligence."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="availability"><span></span> AI vision · data systems · deployment</p>
      <h1>Computer vision for the real world.</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">
        I am Abdurakhmon Dadaboev, an AI vision engineer and Big Data Science master's candidate at Korea University. I turn imperfect data into practical systems for road inspection, data curation, and offline document intelligence.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#selected-work" class="btn">View selected work <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>
        <a href="/resume" class="btn btn-secondary">Read my resume</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="portrait-panel">
      <Image
        src="/images/profile-2026.jpeg"
        width={1110}
        height={1250}
        alt="Abdurakhmon Dadaboev wearing a white shirt"
        class="portrait"
        loading="eager"
      />
      <div class="portrait-caption">
        <div>
          <strong>Abdurakhmon Dadaboev</strong>
          <span>Alex</span>
        </div>
        <span>Sejong, South Korea</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="proof-grid" aria-label="Profile highlights">
    <div><strong>4.46 / 4.5</strong><span>M.S. GPA</span></div>
    <div><strong>TOPIK 6</strong><span>Korean proficiency</span></div>
    <div><strong>4 languages</strong><span>Global collaboration</span></div>
    <div><strong>Aug 2026</strong><span>M.S. expected</span></div>
  </section>

  <section id="selected-work" class="work-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Selected work</p>
        <h2>Built around real constraints.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Recent systems where data quality, deployment conditions, and human review matter as much as model accuracy.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-3 work-grid">
      <a href="/research-and-projects/north-american-road-data" class="card work-card featured">
        <div class="work-top"><span>01</span><span class="badge">Current</span></div>
        <h3>North American road-data pipeline</h3>
        <p>Mapillary collection, DINOv3 embeddings, FAISS similarity search, and a human review tool for scalable road-image curation.</p>
        <ul><li>Mapillary API</li><li>DINOv3</li><li>FAISS</li></ul>
        <span class="work-link">Read project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
      </a>

      <a href="/research-and-projects/road-damage-detection" class="card work-card">
        <div class="work-top"><span>02</span><span class="badge badge-warm">Certified</span></div>
        <h3>Road-damage segmentation</h3>
        <p>Reframed irregular crack detection from bounding boxes to polygon masks and delivered a certified multi-stage vision pipeline.</p>
        <ul><li>YOLO11</li><li>Segmentation</li><li>Data redesign</li></ul>
        <span class="work-link">Read project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
      </a>

      <a href="/research-and-projects/omr-htr-digitization" class="card work-card">
        <div class="work-top"><span>03</span><span class="badge badge-warm">Offline</span></div>
        <h3>Exam OCR system</h3>
        <p>An offline workflow for PDF alignment, OMR-based student matching, answer extraction, OCR, and structured result storage.</p>
        <ul><li>OpenCV</li><li>OMR + OCR</li><li>Local inference</li></ul>
        <span class="work-link">Read project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="approach-section">
    <div class="approach-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">How I work</p>
      <h2>A useful model starts before training.</h2>
      <p>I begin with the operating environment: what data exists, what can fail, what a user must review, and what resources are available. Then I choose the simplest technical path that can produce evidence.</p>
      <a href="/about" class="text-link">More about my path <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <ol class="principles">
      <li><span>01</span><div><strong>Define the real problem</strong><p>Translate a broad goal into data rules, failure cases, and a measurable decision.</p></div></li>
      <li><span>02</span><div><strong>Build for the environment</strong><p>Account for memory, latency, offline use, API limits, and the human workflow.</p></div></li>
      <li><span>03</span><div><strong>Validate with evidence</strong><p>Use small experiments and clear comparisons before scaling the system.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="contact-strip">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
      <h2>Let’s build something useful.</h2>
    </div>
    <a href="mailto:dadaboev170998@gmail.com" class="btn">dadaboev170998@gmail.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </section>

  <style>
    .hero {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(18rem, 0.75fr);
      gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
      align-items: center;
      padding-block: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem) clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    }
    .availability {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.55rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.45rem;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.73rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .availability span {
      width: 0.55rem;
      height: 0.55rem;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #2ba775;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(43, 167, 117, 0.1);
    }
    .hero h1 { max-width: 10ch; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .hero-lead { max-width: 44rem; font-size: clamp(1.04rem, 2vw, 1.23rem); line-height: 1.72; }
    .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
    .portrait-panel {
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      background: var(--surface);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }
    .portrait { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 0.88; display: block; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 18%; }
    .portrait-caption { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding: 1rem 1.15rem 1.1rem; font-size: 0.74rem; }
    .portrait-caption div { display: flex; gap: 0.45rem; }
    .portrait-caption strong { color: var(--ink); }
    .portrait-caption span { color: var(--ink-muted); }
    .proof-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      margin-bottom: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
      border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .proof-grid div { padding: 1.25rem; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .proof-grid div:last-child { border-right: 0; }
    .proof-grid strong, .proof-grid span { display: block; }
    .proof-grid strong { margin-bottom: 0.2rem; color: var(--ink); font-size: 1rem; }
    .proof-grid span { color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 0.75rem; }
    .work-section { scroll-margin-top: 6rem; margin-bottom: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem); }
    .work-card { min-height: 23rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .work-card.featured { background: var(--accent-soft); border-color: #c9e6d6; }
    .work-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 2.4rem; color: var(--ink-muted); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.72rem; }
    .work-card h3 { max-width: 16ch; margin-bottom: 0.85rem; font-size: 1.35rem; }
    .work-card p { margin-bottom: 1.3rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .work-card ul { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.45rem; margin-bottom: 1.7rem; list-style: none; }
    .work-card li { padding: 0.25rem 0.55rem; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.68rem; }
    .work-link { margin-top: auto; color: var(--ink); font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; }
    .approach-section {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
      gap: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 6.5rem);
      align-items: start;
      margin-bottom: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
      padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      color: white;
      background: #111a15;
    }
    .approach-section .eyebrow { color: #71d7ab; }
    .approach-section h2 { max-width: 10ch; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; color: white; }
    .approach-section p { color: #aebbb3; }
    .text-link { display: inline-flex; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1.4rem; color: white; font-size: 0.86rem; font-weight: 650; }
    .principles { list-style: none; }
    .principles li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr; gap: 1rem; padding: 1.35rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); }
    .principles li:first-child { padding-top: 0; }
    .principles li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
    .principles > li > span { color: #71d7ab; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; }
    .principles strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.96rem; }
    .principles p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.82rem; }
    .contact-strip { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 2rem; padding-top: 3rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .contact-strip .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 0.65rem; }
    .contact-strip h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); }
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .portrait-panel { max-width: 27rem; }
      .approach-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      .proof-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .proof-grid div:nth-child(2) { border-right: 0; }
      .proof-grid div:nth-child(-n+2) { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .contact-strip { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
      .contact-strip .btn { width: 100%; font-size: 0.76rem; }
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
